    {
      "id": "v030-question",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "ONE QUESTION\n\nCan uninformed players manage and explain graded sight, movement sound, full-cover relocation, and portable/fixed distractions without a stealth meter?\n\nPrimary: F3 OFF\nIntegration: F3 ON",
      "x": 500,
      "y": 330,
      "width": 430,
      "height": 280,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "v030-cuts",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "TWO-DAY CUT ORDER\n\n1. Panel-ready polish\n2. Extra 3 portable props\n3. Panel visual variants\n4. Nonessential log wording\n\nNever cut priority fairness, hearing threshold, reset, tests, or build gate.",
